2 with Stacy Williams, Vice President of Marketing for Dermavant Sciences, Dr. Fara and Stacy chat about the role of women in dermatology and the future they're building for the next generation of dermatologists. Listen to the podcast. Watch the podcast.Episode 5Live Stream Replay: Future of Dermatology in the Age of Artificial IntelligenceThis livestream was recorded on August 25, 2023, at the SF Derm Society Eczema Symposium and 100 year Celebration with moderator Dr. Ekama Carlson, MD, PhD, and panalists Dr. John YM Koo, MD, Dr. April Armstrong, MD MPH, and Dr. Faranak Kamangar, MD. Panelists discuss the past, present, and future of dermatology along with Dr. Fara's new innovation DermGPT and the inclusion of AI. Listen to the podcast. Watch the podcast.Episode 6Taking ChancesDr. Fara chats with Dr. Bryan Cho, MD, PhD, about the future of dermatology, wearables, and entrepreneurship. Listen to the podcast. Watch the podcast.Episode 7Precision Medicine & Psoriasis TrendsDr. Fara chats with her mentor, ",
