          "title": "https://www.sfderm.org/projects-3",
          "text": "The Future of Dermatology Podcast | sfderm-com top of pageAboutLegacyBoard MembersClimate Change PledgeAnnouncements & NewsMeetingsUpcoming MeetingsRecent MeetingsArchiveResourcesThe Future of Dermatology PodcastDermPubExpertsPhototherapyClinical TrialsPatient AdvocacyProfessional SocietiesMembershipContact UsEventsMoreUse tab to navigate through the menu items.The Future of Dermatology PodcastJoin Dr. Faranak Kamangar, MD, every week as she chats with various guests about the future of Dermatology. Each week, Dr. Fara and her guests cover topics from psoriasis, to eczema, to skin care, to AI, and more. Whether you're a doctor or a patient, these episodes provide valuable information about your skin and how to navigate the world of Dermatology.Episode 0Meet Dr. FaraDr. Faranak Kamangar, MD, introduces us to The Future of Dermatology in episode 0, where she gives us a brief overview of her first eight episodes, all recorded in beautiful Napa, California at the Centennial Celebration, Eczema Symposium. Listen to the podcast. Watch the podcast.Episode 1What is the Best Practice Setting?Dr. Carlson, MD, PhD, did the thing we're all afraid to do, and started a successful private practice- Dr. Kamangar and Dr. Carlson discuss different dermatology practice models. Listen to the podcast. Watch the podcast.Episode 2The Science of ItchDr. Fara chats with Dr. Tim Berger, MD, about new findings in the science of itch. Did you know that skin nerves have memory? Listen to find out why you just can't scratch that itch. Listen to the podcast. Watch the podcast.Episode 3How Did Your Prescription Pad Become a Suggestion Pad?In part I of 2, Dr. Fara chats with Stacy Williams, Vice President of Marketing for Dermavant Sciences about empowering patients and caregivers to ask the questions and advocate for yourself when it comes to your prescriptions. Listen to the podcast. Watch the podcast.Episode 4What Does a Leader Look Like and What is Executive Presence?In part 2 with Stacy Williams, Vice President of Marketing for Dermavant Sciences, Dr. Fara and Stacy chat about the role of women in dermatology and the future they're building for the next generation of dermatologists. Listen to the podcast. Watch the podcast.Episode 5Live Stream Replay: Future of Dermatology in the Age of Artificial IntelligenceThis livestream was recorded on August 25, 2023, at the SF Derm Society Eczema Symposium and 100 year Celebration with moderator Dr. Ekama Carlson, MD, PhD, and panalists Dr. John YM Koo, MD, Dr. April Armstrong, MD MPH, and Dr. Faranak Kamangar, MD. Panelists discuss the past, present, and future of dermatology along with Dr. Fara's new innovation DermGPT and the inclusion of AI. Listen to the podcast. Watch the podcast.Episode 6Taking ChancesDr. Fara chats with Dr. Bryan Cho, MD, PhD, about the future of dermatology, wearables, and entrepreneurship. Listen to the podcast. Watch the podcast.Episode 7Precision Medicine & Psoriasis TrendsDr. Fara chats with her mentor, ",
